a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medea_(disambiguation\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medea_(disambiguation</a>)<br /> <br /> \ud83d\ude09","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T01:06:46-08:00","id":1027492,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1026307-whatever-happend-to-the-heavy-hitters?p=1027330#post1027330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what about Hecate or Morgana? im curious about the &quot;Original&quot; mages</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well if you take the stories literally, Hecate was a goddess of magic, not a human witch/mage.<br /> <br /> Morgana might still be hanging out in Avalon, which would be an Umbral realm tied to a quintessence supply from the node in Glastonbury (thus preventing its permanent residents from becoming spirits). She could easily be a reclusive Archmage of the Verbena.<br /> <br /> Of course like any Archmage who receded to Umbral realms built around their specific paradigm and thus became disengaged from the direct concerns of Earth, high liklihood she was lost when the Avatar Storm came down if you're using that stage of the metaplot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T06:33:39-08:00","id":1027593,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1026307-whatever-happend-to-the-heavy-hitters?p=1027283#post1027283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Merlin was supposed to age backwards, wasn't he? I would assume that he ascended, but only <b>before</b> the Sixth Century A.D. when all his exploits made it into history.</div> </div> </div> </div>Folklore holds that Nimue sealed Merlin up in a tomb / forest / sacred tree / other object. So perhaps he never had the opportunity to ascend but will instead return at some point in the future...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7356-haldir2012","name":"haldi